Medicare ERP v1.0.0 — First Version Release
This is the inaugural release of Medicare ERP, a full-stack Hospital Management System (HMS) built with a decoupled client-server architecture. The app version is explicitly set to "1.0.0" in the FastAPI entrypoint. main.py:54-58

The project spans 26 commits from the initial commit on 2026-03-17 to the latest on 2026-04-13.

Technology Stack
Layer	Technology
Backend	Python / FastAPI (async)
Frontend	React / Vite + Tailwind CSS
Database	PostgreSQL via SQLAlchemy ORM
Real-time	WebSockets (native FastAPI)
Payments	M-PESA Daraja API integration
Auth	JWT + secure HTTP-only cookies
Rate Limiting	SlowAPI
