Key Features Delivered in v1.0.0
Authentication & RBAC — JWT-based login with secure HTTP-only cookies, role-based access control, rate-limited login attempts. user.py:4-17
Real-time notifications — WebSocket endpoint at /ws/notifications/{user_id} for live sync across departments. main.py:89-96
Full patient lifecycle — Registration → Queue → Triage → Consultation → Lab → Pharmacy → Billing.
Laboratory module — Catalog-driven test ordering with inventory consumption tracking and billed price lock-in at order time. laboratory.py:39-69
Billing with M-PESA — Invoice items with universal linkers (item_type + reference_id) decoupling billing from specific modules, plus eTIMS tax compliance fields. billing.py:25-44
Dynamic worker dashboard — Fetches permissions from DB and renders role-appropriate agenda. TODO.md:15-20
Deployment — Backend on Render, frontend on Vercel (with preview branch CORS support). main.py:71-86
